dirtransfert (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New Slint UI with R_M_X design charter, replaces egui/eframe GUI.
  * Fixed non-functional buttons (mode, start reading inputs, cancel token).
  * Fixed truncated labels; monospace for technical data, centered values.
  * Default listen address (0.0.0.0:47500) prefilled in receive mode.
  * Resizable, scrollable log area.
  * Removed eframe/egui stack; file picker uses XDG portal (no GTK).

 -- 0rmx0 <0rmx0@users.noreply.github.com>  $(date -u '+%a, %d %b %Y %H:%M:%S +0000')

dirtransfert (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Cancel button (GUI) and cancellation token in send/receive engine.
  * Configurable request pipeline (--pipeline / GUI slider, 1-64, default 8).
  * Pre-generated pairing code on receive start.
  * Actionable Linux firewall message (ufw/firewall-cmd).
  * GUI footer reserved via bottom panel; docs updated (Releases, CHANGELOG).

 -- 0rmx0 <0rmx0@users.noreply.github.com>  $(date -u '+%a, %d %b %Y %H:%M:%S +0000')

dirtransfert (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: direction byte in nonce to prevent cross-direction nonce reuse.
  * Chunked streaming transfer (1 MiB frames), no more full files in RAM.
  * Pipelined file requests, explicit OK/FAIL final status, I/O timeouts.
  * Removed hand-rolled SHA-256 in favor of the sha2 crate.
  * CI workflow (fmt, clippy, tests).

